    },
    {
        "text": "'Elias, hope you're doing well.'"
    },
    {
        "text": "'I hear you went south. Right now, we might just be on opposite ends of this continent.'"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Sami is a tranquil and peaceful place. I like the environment and atmosphere here a lot. It reminds me of my home, at times.'"
    },
    {
        "text": "'I'm looking forward to Ash's reaction after she finds out we treated her map listing dangerous regions as a tourism guide.'"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Our goal is unanimous. There has to be a reason behind the crossing we made, and I'll find the answer.'"
    },
    {
        "text": "'The answers to strange questions are always hiding in strange places. Maybe one of us will be able to locate it.'"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Good luck.'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
