    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The hunter holds her breath and waits, finger on her trigger."
    },
    {
        "text": "In her sight is a fowlbeast, wandering back and forth in the forest, leaving one footprint after another in the snow."
    },
    {
        "text": "It too is a scavenger, seeking other life to allow its own to persist in this harsh environment."
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems to have seen something, standing its slender neck straight, sharp beak aimed towards its prey."
    },
    {
        "text": "In one and the same instant, it spreads its wings, and the hunter pulls the trigger."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_arrowshot",
        "channel": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_wing",
        "channel": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "So close!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very close.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is some rotten luck.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Some fowl are good at catching onto how the air moves. Some have especially sensitive claws, so they can sense the slightest tremor in the ground.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "For every different kind of prey, there's a different trick to concealing yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, that's a lesson learned. Luck's not so bad looking at it that way\u2014what kind of fowl did I lose just now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You didn't. Its time just isn't up yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that written in the prophecy too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You still don't believe it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just... unable to comprehend it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've always seemed like a smart hunter, since we first got to know each other. Ample experience, and keen too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let alone how healthy you still are. I honestly can't believe it when you say it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Experience isn't the end-all, nor is judgment critical. Your being on this journey at this very moment is already enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "'On this earth, there are special rules to survival?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Exactly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right now, we should continue setting out north.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "If what we already know is accurate, it's just deserted tundra north of the forest. The further north we go, the less prey we can catch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "text": "Chances are we probably just missed our last meal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't be so uneasy. The prophecy only mentioned my death, but you\u2014you'll find what you've been searching for all this time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
