    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Several days before"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "A journey to where your life ends?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've seen it. I've seen my death in the prophecy already. But before it happens, I have a request.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, take me north. We'll start from here, and bear north straight, until we emerge from the woods. If I still haven't breathed my last by then, then let us keep on northward.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've spent enough long, untroubled years in this little wood cabin. Before I die, I want to see some sights I've never seen before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm old and frail now. This is a journey I can't complete alone. So, I must ask for your help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir, if this is truly your last wish, then of course. I'll help you any way I can.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "text": "But what I can't understand is, how are you certain your life's almost over? I'm not even sure how much 'head straight north' can count as a dream...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "How funny. Even in Sami, nobody would call a Sarkaz 'Sir.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I respect you a lot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The prophecy remains clear. In the end, I will surely reach the place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is my final request. Take me with you, just as the prophecy showed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't have you help for nothing. At this journey's conclusion, I will provide a reward. And you will find what you've been searching for all this time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
