        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "channel": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're definitely advancing north, according to the compass. But the plant distribution and atmosphere in our surroundings show no stronger characteristics of a polar climate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whether it's the compass or common sense, something's gotta be wrong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sami allowed a Sarkaz to retire here\u2014because many a thing here poses more trouble than an old devil man.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let us go on. We haven't strayed from the course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you so sure? According to you, you'd never been here before, nor were you at all familiar.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "True, I have never set foot beyond the forest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it's not experience we depend on to recognize reality. When you realize experience cannot allow you to see reality clearly, you will be one step closer to touching upon it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright. Those sound like the words of someone with experience.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "text": "Regardless, I have to admit too much of this world is beyond my common sense... So, are we still heading onward?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes\u2014*cough*, *cough* *cough*... We head onward.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe... we could take a break for a moment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "A fine suggestion. We still have time, and so do I.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Frost sweeps away a patch of snow by a tree, lays a layer of fallen leaves on top of it, and invites the old hunter to sit."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is day nine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "text": "Prey is dwindling for sure. Supplies are scarce too\u2014and we still need to figure out how to get back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't mind me. After we reach the end of our journey, you will return alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry, I still have some doubts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "text": "Does the prophecy have some kind of concrete information, if you believe so firmly in it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like this journey's destination, or what kind of preparations we should make?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or even more fundamentally, did this prophecy tell you should go someplace, or was this journey just a wish of yours...? I'm not quite sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your confusion is understandable. When most have a problem, they can only act once they receive a definite answer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "But prophecies never give answers. Prophecies do not work that way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it did state clearly you would die?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Death is hardly an answer either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard the people here mention 'prophecy' before I met you, too. Is it a common skill around these parts?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Truthfully, each and every one of us is capable of prophecy. We see the dark clouds gathering, and so know rain is about to fall. It's simple as that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm still finding this hard to comprehend.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then we can stop talking about prophecy, and turn simply to our travels.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. You told me before how you'd been to a lot of places, too. If you still remember, that is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "text": "Spires that bring down the rain, lakes under the sea, trenches buried beneath the ground, cities on the backs of behemoths. And as well as that, 'a nonexistent home.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "text": "The stories all start intriguing, but you never finish telling them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course I remember them, whether they were travels or stories.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "A journey should conclude when it's still worth reflecting on, and a story should end when its audience is still interested.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ooh, that's definitely not an excuse to dismiss your audience.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then let us pass the time. Allow me to finish telling my last story.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Remind me, where did I get to? No, no need. I remember now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$drift_intro",
        "key": "$drift_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "In the end, I accompanied that cursed, vile beast as it found that caster. Indignantly, it asked: 'Where, after all, is my home?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "'All beings have an origin. Since they have an origin, there must be a place they are born. Yet why do I not? Could it be my existence was never meant?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Caster answered: 'This is the rule of the curse. You exchanged your home for wisdom, and the power to make all people fear. But now you forever lost your home; true, you should not exist!'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "The beast was full of anger, and desired to savage the Caster to death. But still it calmed down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Revenge was of no avail. It would not solve the contradiction its own existence posed. And an irrational existence is preordained to disappear.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Finally, the cursed beast chose to run, incessantly. So long as it never stopped in any one place, no part of this land would come to mean 'home,' nor 'away' to it, anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "How wise of the beast, to solve the crisis of its own existence so. However, I had no energy to continue to run with it. I could only choose to stay in my little wood hut, and while away the rest of my days.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "A very metaphorical story.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Through metaphor, one is acquainted with reality.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not through experience, but through metaphor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You come to understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, the end of your prophesied journey is also something to do with 'home?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "That is exactly what I expect.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm still very curious. Before you settled down in Sami, just how many places did you go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "More than enough. To the point my life could have ended at any point, and it would be no regretful thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "At times I was a mercenary, at times a hunter, and times more still a simple traveler.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Both you and I share that passion for adventure, it seems.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "'A scene never before seen is a priceless treasure.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We had to go far no matter what, to appreciate something worth the view.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just as that vile beast that could never stop.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Another layer of metaphor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, then. It's your turn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fellow traveler, surely you have plenty of stories worth sharing yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've definitely got plenty of stories about my travels I could tell, but I'm worried they might be just as hard to understand for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You come from a very distant place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Distant for sure. Farther away than we can even perceive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then perhaps, you could say, it is far enough to be ancient?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now there's a tricky question to answer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Never mind. I won't seek an answer. To appreciate a story hardly requires making every detail clear.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, continue telling.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, if you're okay with listening.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've told this story to practically no one, but if you're going to understand where I come from, then it'll serve as a fine case.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not some adventure to be proud of. It starts with an emergency landing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_black",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "'A journey into the unknown always makes me happy, despite the risks that often come with it. You understand, I could never refuse the call.'"
    },
    {
        "text": "'People always find gain in their travels. At times, it's scenes that bring happiness. At times, it's other ways of looking at the world.'"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Like that wise old hunter said, we're unable to tolerate the existence of questions with no answers. Just as if every lock has some key made to match.'"
    },
    {
        "text": "'But that's only wishful thinking. It's not the logic of what nature makes. It's kind of like a Zen thing, isn't it?'"
    },
    {
        "text": "'I'm trying to figure it out now. It might help us answer our question.'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We're here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_snow_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "So this is what's north of the forest?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is 'home.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean these ruins?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stumbling, the old hunter sits down, the long and arduous journey having taken the last of his energy."
    },
    {
        "text": "He gazes at the ruined, broken walls before him, his expression like a man admiring the most beautiful scenery."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Atop these ruins, there once was a grand city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "More than once it was destroyed, and more than once it was rebuilt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Would a city really go in a place as desolate as this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "And below the barrage of fire was once a sea of flowers, and above the scorched earth were once skyscrapers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Kazdel.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "As the prophecy told, it will in the end become the home of all Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Sarkaz Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold on, something's wrong\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_black",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_battlefield",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_forest",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_iceforest_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_desert_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_black",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "In an instant, the boundless scenery surrounding her collapses."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "40_g2_glacier",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "What's going on...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Frost looks all around. Before her, and behind her, all that remains is endless tundra."
    },
    {
        "text": "The path they came by is gone without a trace, like the morning dew, and the magnet of the compass in her hands is deathly still, pointed straight ahead."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The good news is we probably didn't lose our way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "text": "If this is also part of the metaphors you talked about... Sir?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Frost only now realizes that the old man beside her is no longer breathing."
    },
    {
        "text": "The old hunter looks towards the cold empty expanse, his face full of serenity."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A journey to where your life ends.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is your last wish granted, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Frost sits down to the side of the old hunter, and the two hunters together admire the landscape at the end of their journey."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "38_g21_skystarry_R1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There's\u2014only one moon in the sky.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "text": "Opposite where the sun sets, a single moon appears faint on the horizon. A pale silver silhouette, in the same shade as the boundless tundra."
    },
    {
        "text": "Frost only learns later that upon this great land, this is a sight so very rarely seen."
    },
    {
        "text": "'A scene never before seen is a priceless treasure.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright. This is a reward I'm willing to take.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
